title: "Feature insights into Somalia’s severe acute malnutrition admissions"
subtitle: "A time series analysis spanning from January 2019 to December 2024"
---

```{r}
#| label: source-script
#| message: false
Sys.setenv(path_secret_key = "~/.ssh/id_rsa")
