    High peak :luc2, 5, 6
    Not available :luc3, 6, 10
    Peak :luc4, 10, 11
    Not avail. :luc5, 11, 12

    section AFI National Seasons
    Jilaal :afi1, 1, 4
    Gu     :afi2, 4, 7
    Post-Gu:afi3, 7, 8
    Hagaa  :afi4, 7, 10
